Transferência de calor em barras — UFSC LABOPE (@th-ufsc-lab: 0, is #reference, #part-of @th-sources) { r_3HAWSMZM80J3ZMZK362ED9E3C1
Universidade Federal de Santa Catarina, LABOPE. [Teaching apparatus and experimental context](https://labeqagrad.paginas.ufsc.br/transferencia-de-calor-em-barras/).

Study the complete public apparatus description alongside the full fin/conduction/convection chapters in [A Heat Transfer Textbook — Lienhard and Lienhard](A-Heat-Transfer-Textbook-Lienhard.lingua#r_7TKQ2D5YRNQ8XVHXNJQDRANWKD). The installation compares four circular bars, three materials and two diameters, using movable optical temperature sensing. Reconstruct a thermal model, heat-loss and sensor assumptions, and a defensible parameter-estimation study.

This page describes a real educational apparatus; it is not a complete assembly manual or a published dataset. Arrange appropriate supervised apparatus access for physical work, or label a documentary reconstruction accurately. Check the separate rights of linked commercial readings and equipment documentation. The site update date is not proof of an experiment's performance date.

